WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:02.802
-Welcome back to "Late Night."
We're here with George Lopez.

00:00:02.802 --> 00:00:04.837
You alluded to one of your
co-stars in a way,

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:06.372
the great Cheech Marin.

00:00:06.372 --> 00:00:09.475
-Cheech, yes, my boyhood hero.

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:11.644
Love Cheech and Chong.

00:00:11.644 --> 00:00:13.813
You know, I went to his house
in Malibu and we made

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.549
some shrimp and stuff,
watching the sun come down.

00:00:16.549 --> 00:00:17.983
And he's like,
"You want to smoke a joint?"

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:20.854
And I'm like..."Yes."

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.588
[ Laughter ]

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:25.591
But my tolerance isn't high.
So, we're on the roof

00:00:25.591 --> 00:00:28.061
and we're smoking weed,
and it's going back and forth.

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:30.230
And then, you know, the sun is
coming down.

00:00:30.230 --> 00:00:31.531
And he's like,
"Thanks for coming over."

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:34.567
And I get in my car,
and I'm looking at the gate.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:36.335
And the gate looks like
it's opening.

00:00:36.335 --> 00:00:39.873
So, I'm like, "Is it opening?"

00:00:39.873 --> 00:00:42.708
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:44.577
20 minutes later I hear...

00:00:44.577 --> 00:00:46.212
And I roll the window down.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:48.148
It's Cheech. He goes, "Hey, man,
you're too far from the gate.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:50.817
Man, you got to pull forward."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:53.419
I was like 40 feet
from the gate.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:56.055
[ Laughter ]

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:58.558
-I bet Cheech has to go out in
the driveway a fair amount.

00:00:58.558 --> 00:01:00.092
-I'm pretty sure.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.092 --> 00:01:01.528
-Here you guys are
back in the day.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:03.095
-Oh, my God.

00:01:03.095 --> 00:01:05.698
-Again, unnoticeable even.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:05.698 --> 00:01:09.268
And here you guys are now.
Look at that.

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.203
You also --
I want to shout out --

00:01:11.203 --> 00:01:12.572
This is another legend
right here.

00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:14.941
-That best.
-I mean, what's it like

00:01:14.941 --> 00:01:16.676
to work with Rita Moreno again?
-Amazing.

00:01:16.676 --> 00:01:18.978
-Again, here she is in
the original "Lopez."

00:01:18.978 --> 00:01:20.979
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:20.979 --> 00:01:22.215
And here she is again.

00:01:22.215 --> 00:01:26.752
Can we just say with
all due respect to you,

00:01:26.752 --> 00:01:27.921
with all due respect to Cheech,

00:01:27.921 --> 00:01:29.588
no one's keeping it together
like Rita Moreno.

00:01:29.588 --> 00:01:30.956
-Nobody is keeping it
together --

00:01:30.956 --> 00:01:33.259
-No one is aging better than
Rita.

00:01:33.259 --> 00:01:34.494
-I sure -- I'm not.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:35.828
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.828 --> 00:01:37.430
She's 90 years old.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:38.764
-Unbelievable.

00:01:38.764 --> 00:01:43.670
-She slept with Elvis to make
Marlon Brando jealous.

00:01:43.670 --> 00:01:47.073
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.073 --> 00:01:49.508
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:49.508 --> 00:01:52.345
-That is very -- I mean,
as things go,

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:53.846
that's pretty impressive.
-That's pretty impressive.

00:01:53.846 --> 00:01:56.049
Also, I'm a conspiracy theorist.
Like Joe Biden --

00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:58.051
I think everybody is Latino.
-Uh-huh.

00:01:58.051 --> 00:01:59.719
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.719 --> 00:02:02.288
-When you take papers home,
Latino.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:03.689
-Oh, interesting.

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.792
-I'll read them here, then I'll
finish them up at home.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.826
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.826 --> 00:02:09.228
You always take things home.

00:02:09.228 --> 00:02:12.198
-Hey, who are you -- Obviously,
we got Rita there.

00:02:12.198 --> 00:02:15.434
We got Cheech there. Who's your
dream guest to be on the sitcom?

00:02:15.434 --> 00:02:17.436
-It's got to be Jennifer Lopez.

00:02:17.436 --> 00:02:21.240
I mean, come on. Jennifer Lopez.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.610
Lopez vs. Lopez vs. Lopez.

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:26.546
-There you go.

00:02:26.546 --> 00:02:28.748
-You talk about the Lopez way
on the show.

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:30.483
How would you describe for those

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:31.985
who don't know what
the Lopez way is?

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:34.620
-You know what?
I have been doing stand-up

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:37.056
a long time, and it's been
very kind to me.

00:02:37.056 --> 00:02:39.091
I have a great life.

00:02:39.091 --> 00:02:41.794
Where I came from,
the Lopez way is --

00:02:41.794 --> 00:02:43.562
Seth, when there is
no other way.

00:02:43.562 --> 00:02:44.930
-Uh-huh.

00:02:44.930 --> 00:02:48.134
-And you still have to succeed,
the Lopez way.

00:02:48.134 --> 00:02:49.268
-Well, there you go.

00:02:49.268 --> 00:02:51.337
It's been working out alright
for you.

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:54.040
It's lovely to see you and your
family out on camera together.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.074
Thanks so much for being here.

00:02:55.074 --> 00:02:56.408
You guys, give it up
for George Lopez!

00:02:56.408 --> 00:02:57.477
-Thank you very much.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:57.477 --> 00:03:00.480
-"Lopez vs Lopez" airs Friday
on NBC

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:01.714
and streams the next day
on Peacock.

00:03:01.714 --> 00:03:03.383
We'll be right back
with Sadie Sink.

